flowchart LR
    A[RAVDESS WAV recordings] --> B[Parse labels and actor IDs]
    B --> C[Group split before augmentation]
    C --> D[Train actors: waveform augmentation]
    C --> E[Validation/test actors: original audio]
    D --> F[Extract and mean-pool 275 acoustic features]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Fit StandardScaler on train only]
    G --> H[Conv1D 64 + Conv1D 128]
    H --> I[Bidirectional LSTM 128]
    I --> J[Dense 256 + Dense 128]
    J --> K[8-class softmax]
    K --> L[Validation selection and checkpoint]
    L --> M[Held-out test evaluation in full pipeline]

